pkg:Evidence_v1_17_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.17.0 (STORY-6 built)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: built STORY-6 (real page ABox work) backed by the prior turn's test-driven investigation -- confirmed via direct read that the RDODI default deliverable's own procedure text (steps 4-6) explicitly requires a page ABox, and confirmed via direct inspection that zero ABox-generation tooling exists in the corpus-instantiation template. Assigned a real, honestly-disclosed cost estimate (5, Low confidence) reflecting the genuine unsolved design question -- how Stage4.H-K's widget-intention model, built for per-section click-reveal widgets, applies to this pattern's actual interactivity. Added to the Epic's decomposesInto and the 3 objectives it actually advances; dependsOn STORY-3 and STORY-5 (both already Done), Now horizon. One real editing error caught and fixed immediately during the build (a str_replace that dropped the Roadmap1 individual's own declaration), caught by re-parsing before proceeding. Re-verified: pipeline order (Stage_Backlog digest recomputed to 35 subjects, reproduces), full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "07deb68b3c7a5df8b30416f00921f057b4f52f882ca9ee14a9bc5f78fcda0801"^^xsd:string .
